Migration of ListItems (user -> teams pagination) reads from cassandra to postgres. Adds a required `postgresMigration.listItems` key to galley/brig/background-worker config; keep it on `cassandra` until the `teamStore` migration has finished (`wire_team_members_migration_finished == 1.0`), then flip to `postgresql`. Internal user deletion now drains team memberships with proper pagination instead of a single 100-team page.
